02:06:41.780 --> 02:06:48.200
and then you get caught out because you
have no longs in your portfolio

02:06:48.200 --> 02:06:52.800
and the market goes up and you get
squeezed on all of your short positions.

02:06:53.380 --> 02:06:58.700
By the same token, it's not good enough to
have a situation where your long mid-caps,

02:06:59.140 --> 02:07:01.080
short large caps overall.

02:07:01.520 --> 02:07:05.600
And in an expansionary phase, the market
keeps going up.

02:07:06.140 --> 02:07:08.520
