02:07:15.980 --> 02:07:18.040
This means you're just being whipsawed.

02:07:18.220 --> 02:07:22.360
You're opening yourself up to potential
large losses in your portfolio.

02:07:22.360 --> 02:07:28.340
And it's very obviously not a sensible
approach to apply right across the board.

